ounts from 4 recorders located in Calderdale. Notes: Sdate - indicates the date and time the count was taken. Cosit - site ID number which indicates the recorder location (see Counter Locations document below). Period - length of time count was taken. LaneNumber - Lane ID number which indicates the number of lanes. LaneDirection - the number of directions the lane or lanes go. Direction - the direction of the lane. Volume - the number of bicycles counted, if the number is negative the count has been discarded. Flag Text - Additional information e.g. roadworks, holiday, etc The Cycle Lane Counter Dashboard is a visualisation of this raw data showing the volume of cyclists by month/year and counter location.", "num_resources": 13, "num_tags": 6, "organization": {"id": "8f45940b-a372-4709-9119-cf19ac249ede", "name": "calderdale-metropolitan-borough-council", "title": "Calderdale Metropolitan Borough Council", "type": "organization", "description": "", "image_url": "", "created": "2012-06-27T14:50:08.577384", "is_organization": true, "approval_status": "approved", "state": "active"}, "owner_org": "8f45940b-a372-4709-9119-cf19ac249ede", "private": false, "state": "active", "title": "Cycle Lane Counter", "type": "dataset", "url": "https://dataworks.calderdale.gov.uk/dataset/cycle-lane-counter-2ld68", "version": null, "extras": [{"key": "dcat_issued", "value": "2020-09-16T12:26:51.342Z"}, {"key": "dcat_modified", "value": "2025-01-25T09:19:00.000Z"}, {"key": "dcat_publisher_name", "value": "Calderdale Council"}, {"key": "guid", "value": "2ld68"}, {"key": "language", "value": ""}, {"key": "harvest_object_id", "value": "db0e1656-7737-4415-9a17-3cc24b12882b"}, {"key": "harvest_source_id", "value": "fb844ae9-98e5-4d92-8ee5-3df864a6cea5"}, {"key": "harvest_source_title", "value": "Calderdale Dataworks"}], "resources": [{"cache_last_updated": null, "cache_url": null, "created": "2026-09-19T17:00:43.094134", "description": "", "format": "", "hash": "", "id": "7c6b6e75-d775-4437-8